<title>INDONESIA: Mulialand to issue 150 bln rph bond.</title>
<headline>Mulialand to issue 150 bln rph bond.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's property developer PT Mulialand said on Tuesday it planned to issue a five-year 150 billion rupiah straight bond this year.</p>
<p>It said the bond, with no specific fixed assets as collateral, would have a fixed interest rate for the first three years and a higher rate for the remaining years. It gave no further details.</p>
<p>Mulialand said the bonds had been rated BBB+ by the Indonesian rating agency Pefindo.</p>
<p>It said proceeds would be used to restructure its borrowings.</p>
<p>Lead underwriter of the issue is PT Bahana Securities.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
